                                "sense_id": "66fa7b3e-eaa2-3ba1-90e7-63456a00916c",
                                "text": "Major martyries are often traditional destinations of pilgrimages, hence become chapels or churches beyond the local parish needs"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dff68aba-6c8d-35b0-aa6d-cfe15ddf6efb",
